            desc: 'Kitsilano ("Kits") is Vancouver\'s quintessential West Coast neighborhood — laid-back, health-conscious, and beach-focused. The area has beautiful beaches (Kitsilano Beach, Jericho Beach), ocean views, and a small-town Main Street feel along West 4th Avenue and West Broadway. Kitsilano attracts professionals, families, outdoor enthusiasts, and wellness-focused expats. It feels like a beach town within the city — perfect for anyone who values an active outdoor lifestyle and proximity to nature.',
