      income: 'Progressive tax rates up to 44% on employment income. However, the Non-Dom (7-year exemption) regime allows new tax residents to pay 0% tax on foreign-sourced income for up to 7 years, and 50% reduction on Greek employment income. US citizens must still file US taxes on worldwide income. US-Greece tax treaty helps prevent double taxation.',
