      traffic: 'Traffic can be heavy during rush hour but generally better than Beijing. The metro is the most reliable way to cross districts. The city\'s road network and elevated highways handle traffic reasonably well. High-speed rail connects Guangzhou to the entire Greater Bay Area and rest of China. Baiyun International Airport is a major international hub with direct flights to many global destinations.',
