      note: 'Work visa process same as other cities: work permit notification → Z visa abroad → entry → medical exam → work permit → residence permit. Processing times are typically 4–8 weeks. The large trading community means the visa system is familiar with business and trade applications. Spouses and dependents apply for S1/Q visas.',
