      traffic: 'Traffic is generally manageable, though rush-hour congestion on major roads is common. The metro and high-speed rail make commuting relatively easy. Hangzhou is known as a "mobile payment city" — Alipay was born here and everything is cashless. The city is a leader in smart city initiatives. Biking is extremely popular, and there are extensive dedicated bike lanes around West Lake and throughout the city.',
