      note: 'Work visa process same as other Chinese cities. The Zhejiang provincial and Hangzhou municipal governments are pro-business and pro-talent, with various incentive programs for foreign experts. Many foreign employees of Alibaba and other tech companies receive help with their visa applications through their employers. Spouses and dependents get S1/Q visas.',
