            title: 'Who Lives Here',
            desc: 'Westend is home to bankers, lawyers, consultants, executives, diplomats, and well-off families. The neighborhood has a high concentration of expats working in the financial sector — many international bank employees live here. It is a desirable place for professionals who want to be close to work but also live in a beautiful, green, and quiet neighborhood. Westend has a reputation for being more conservative and affluent than bohemian neighborhoods like Sachsenhausen. Families are drawn by the beautiful parks, good schools, and safe streets. The international community is significant due to the proximity to the financial district and the many multinational companies based in Frankfurt.',
