            title: 'Who Lives Here',
            desc: 'HafenCity is home to young professionals, expats working in the media/shipping/tech industries, architects, and people who want a modern, waterfront lifestyle. The apartments are new and expensive — it is one of the most expensive neighborhoods in Hamburg. The Speicherstadt area is more commercial/office during the day but has residents in some of the converted warehouses. The neighborhood attracts people who value design, architecture, and the waterfront. Families often prefer Eimsbüttel, Winterhude, or other neighborhoods with more parks and schools. The expat community is significant — many international companies have offices in HafenCity and the nearby harbor area.',
