        'The city center is very walkable and compact. The Nidelva River runs through the center — the old bridge (Gamle Bybro) with its colorful warehouses is iconic. Bakklandet (the old working-class neighborhood across the river) is very charming and walkable. The city hills can make walking between neighborhoods steep.',
