        income: 'N/A',
        desc: 'Denmark does not currently have a specific digital nomad visa. However, the Pay Limit Scheme and Positive List offer pathways for workers. The self-employment visa can work for some freelancers. There is discussion about introducing a digital nomad visa but nothing confirmed as of 2024.',
