      cards: 'Debit cards are universal. Denmark is practically cashless — everyone uses Dankort (Danish debit card) or international Visa/Mastercard, or MobilePay (mobile payment). MobilePay is used by 90%+ of Danes for everything from splitting bills to paying at shops. You will need a Danish bank account to use MobilePay.',
