      local: 'Swedish public schools are free and of excellent quality. The Swedish education system is consistently ranked among the best in the world. Many expat families choose local schools for quality and language immersion. Swedish universities are tuition-free for EU/EEA students (non-EU students pay tuition fees). Sweden has a famous "fika" culture — coffee breaks are a workday institution.',
