      note: 'Many excellent international schools in Manila. ISM and Manila American Academy are the main American/IB options. British, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, and other international schools are also available. Tuition is moderate by international standards — cheaper than in China, Japan, or Singapore but more expensive than in Thailand or Vietnam. Many expat families live in BGC, Makati, Alabang, or Quezon City for proximity to top international schools. The quality of international schools is generally very good. The University of the Philippines is the top public university. Education is highly valued in Filipino culture.',
