      score: 55,
      summary: 'Moderate safety. Generally safe in tourist and expat areas. Petty theft is the main concern. Terrorism is a historic concern but has decreased significantly. Use normal precautions.',
      violentCrime: 'Low-Medium — violent crime against expats and tourists is relatively rare. Terrorism has been a concern in the past (bombings) but security has improved significantly. Most crime is non-violent and opportunistic.',
