      vpn: 'VPNs are commonly used by expats. Some VPN sites may be blocked but many work. Useful for accessing some blocked content and for security. Very popular among expats.',
      reliability: 'Variable — can be unreliable in some areas. Speeds have improved but still not as fast as in Singapore or Malaysia. Outages can occur. Mobile data is widely available and 4G speeds are decent. 5G is rolling out in major cities. Internet quality varies significantly by neighborhood and provider.',
