        process: 'Find a job first. Employer applies for RWR card or Blue Card through AMS (Public Employment Service) and immigration authority. You then apply for a D visa at the Austrian embassy/consulate. Upon arrival, get your residence permit. Process takes 2–4 months. Can be bureaucratic.',
