      english: 'Very High — English is the de facto working language and is used everywhere. The majority of the population is expat, so English is the common language. You can live perfectly well without any Arabic. All signs, menus, and services are in English and Arabic. Healthcare, education, and business all operate in English. Learning Arabic is not necessary but basic phrases are appreciated.',
