        desc: 'Vietnam does not have a traditional golden visa program. Investor visas are available (temporary residence card) for those investing in Vietnam. Permanent residency is possible after long-term residency but difficult.',
        note: 'No formal golden visa or citizenship-by-investment program. Investor visas are available but require active business investment. Permanent residency is very rare and difficult to obtain. Vietnam is not an easy country to get long-term residency or citizenship in as a foreigner.',
