      system: 'Good and improving healthcare system. Modern private healthcare with internationally accredited hospitals. Public healthcare is available but basic. Panama is a growing medical tourism destination.',
      public: 'Public healthcare system (CSS - Caja de Seguro Social) is available to workers. Quality varies. Can be crowded and understaffed. Not recommended for expats who can afford private care.',
