        desc: 'Work permits for foreign employees. Employer sponsorship required. Labor market test for some positions. Can take time to process. Leads to permanent residency after several years.',
        process: 'Employer applies for work permit. Then employee applies for residency. Process involves multiple government agencies. Can take 2–4+ months. Various categories depending on the type of work.',
