      note: 'Colombo has several international schools. The Overseas School of Colombo (OSC) and Colombo International School (CIS) are the top options offering IB curricula. British, American, and other international schools are also available. Tuition ranges from affordable to high depending on the school. Many expat families live in Cinnamon Gardens, Colombo 3, or Battaramulla for proximity to international schools. The quality of international schools is generally good but some are better than others. University of Colombo is the main national university. The economic crisis has affected some families and schools but education continues. Overall, good international school options but tuition varies widely.',
