    expatSize: 'Huge expat community — the largest in Southeast Asia. Estimated 200,000+ foreigners in Metro Manila, including 60,000+ Americans. Very diverse.',
    expatUS: 'Very large American community — military veterans, retirees (Social Security), teachers, BPO/tech workers, missionaries, embassy staff, and business people. The Philippines has a long and deep connection to the US.',
