    safetyNote: 'Cuenca is considered one of the safest cities in Ecuador and a very safe place for expats and retirees. The small size, slower pace, and strong sense of community contribute to the feeling of safety. Petty theft is the main concern — be careful with your belongings in crowded markets and near tourist attractions. The expat community is large enough that there is a "safety in numbers" effect. Cuenca consistently ranks well on safety compared to other Latin American cities of similar size.',
