    schoolsNote: 'Fewer international school options than Quito, but there are some quality choices. Many expat families choose to homeschool due to the flexibility and the lifestyle. Online schooling is also popular. The local universities are affordable and some offer programs in English. Overall, Cuenca is more of a retirement destination than a family expat destination, which is reflected in the school options.',
