      'Buses: GVB and EBS bus networks cover areas not reached by tram/metro.',
      'Trains: NS (Nederlandse Spoorwegen) connects Amsterdam to the rest of the country and beyond (Brussels, Paris, Berlin). Schiphol Airport is a 15-minute train ride from the center.',
      'Amsterdam is extremely walkable — the compact city center is flat, pedestrian-friendly, and beautiful. Canal walks are one of the great pleasures of the city. However, bikes are faster and more convenient for most trips.'
