    organicNote: 'Organic options are somewhat limited but improving. The best organic food comes from local farmers markets — Dalmatia produces incredible olive oil, wine, figs, cheese, and seafood. You can get amazingly fresh, local, seasonal produce at the pazar (green market) for very low prices.',
