    climateRain: 'About 780mm annually. Most rain falls in winter (Nov–Feb). Summers are very dry — sometimes no rain for months. ~2,600 hours of sunshine per year.',
    expatSize: 'Growing expat community — estimated 4,000+ foreigners in Split. Includes digital nomads, retirees, teachers, and people working in tourism. Has grown rapidly since the digital nomad visa was introduced in 2021.',
    expatUS: 'Small but fast-growing American community — digital nomads, retirees, teachers, and people working in tourism/tech. Split has become a popular destination for American digital nomads.',
