    expatEnglish: 'High — especially in tourism and coastal areas. Many locals speak English due to decades of tourism. Younger people generally speak better English. You can live and work in Split with only English, but learning some Croatian is appreciated.',
    schoolsSummary: 'Fewer international school options than Zagreb. Some private English-language schools. Many expat families homeschool or do distance learning. Local schools are available but in Croatian.',
