    priceLevel: 'Moderate to high by European standards. Housing is the biggest expense. Groceries are reasonable. Eating out is moderately expensive. Excellent value for cultural offerings (opera standing tickets for €10!). Public transit is incredibly cheap for the quality.',
    organicNote: 'Austria has very high food quality and organic standards. Denns BioMarkt and Billa Bio are widely available. Viennese coffee culture is world-famous. The Naschmarkt is one of the best food markets in Europe. Austria produces excellent wine, cheese, bread, and pastries.',
