    safetyScams: 'Very low — minimal tourist scams. The city is well-organized and honest.',
    safetyNote: 'Salzburg is a very safe city. The only concern is petty theft in crowded tourist areas during peak season (summer and Christmas markets). Otherwise, you can feel very safe walking around at any time of day or night. Austrian efficiency and orderliness contribute to the overall feeling of safety. It is consistently ranked as one of the safest small cities in Europe.',
