    // ===== US Taxes =====
    usTaxOverview: 'US citizens and green card holders must file US federal tax returns regardless of where they live in the world. Key considerations include the Foreign Earned Income Exclusion (FEIE), Foreign Tax Credit (FTC), FBAR (Report of Foreign Bank and Financial Accounts), and FATCA (Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act). Expats should work with a cross-border tax professional to ensure compliance.',

