      "Bangkok Bank is Thailand’s largest bank by total assets and is widely considered the most foreigner-friendly bank in the country. It has a well-deserved reputation for good English service at major branches, a large international department, and established procedures for opening accounts for foreigners. Bangkok Bank offers a range of savings accounts, current (checking) accounts, and fixed deposit accounts. The Bualuang app and online banking provide most services in English. You get a debit card (ATM card) that works at Bangkok Bank ATMs nationwide and at thousands of 7-Eleven stores. For US expats, Bangkok Bank is generally the top recommendation because of its experience with foreign customers, extensive branch network, and reliable service. Note that requirements for opening an account vary by branch — some major branches in Bangkok (Silom, Sathorn) have dedicated foreign banking desks.",
