    accountOverview:
      'Eurobank is one of the four major systemic banks in Greece. It is generally regarded as having the best digital banking platform among the traditional Greek banks — its Eurobank Mobile app and online banking are more modern and user-friendly than NBG or Piraeus. Eurobank has a large branch and ATM network across Greece, though slightly smaller than NBG and Piraeus. For expats, Eurobank is a good choice if digital banking quality is important to you. The bank offers the standard range of retail banking products: current accounts, savings accounts, credit cards, personal loans, mortgages, and investment services. Eurobank was also a pioneer in some digital innovations in Greek banking. Like other Greek banks, Eurobank requires an AFM (tax number) and proper documentation to open an account. The bank is stable and well-capitalized following post-crisis restructuring.',
