    accountOverview:
      "Intesa Sanpaolo is Italy’s largest banking group by total assets, with thousands of branches and ATMs across the country. The Xme Conto Corrente is their standard current account — a full-service account with a debit card, online and mobile banking, and access to the entire Intesa ecosystem. For expats, Intesa Sanpaolo is a solid choice if you want a traditional Italian bank with extensive local presence. The account opening process is bureaucratic but manageable with the right documents. English service is available at some branches in major cities and tourist areas, but you should not expect it everywhere. The bank also offers savings accounts, credit cards, mortgages, investment products, and insurance.",
